From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Reef <reef@localhost>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 15:45:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Skip useless entity move packets

Inspired by Purpur's "Dont send useless entity packets" (MIT, by
William Blake Galbreath).

Minecraft re-sends every tracked entity's position at least once every
60 ticks, even when it hasn't moved. For an entity standing still the
packet's encoded movement is zero, so it changes nothing on the client.
On a server with many idle animals and many players this adds up to a
lot of wasted packets.

Only position-only packets with zero movement are dropped. Unlike
Purpur's version, rotation packets are never dropped (their rotation is
absolute, not a delta, so a value of 0 is a real rotation). On-ground
changes are unaffected because they always use the full sync packet.

Toggle with optimizations.skip-useless-move-packets in reef.yml.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/server/level/ServerEntity.java b/net/minecraft/server/level/ServerEntity.java
index 3a817c92147bb78c60238f3ddc1644b721aed7a2..082105daea8ff0ecf44342da9384fcb5ad9e86ef 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/server/level/ServerEntity.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/server/level/ServerEntity.java
@@ -195,6 +195,17 @@ public class ServerEntity {
                     flag4 = true;
                 }
 
+                // Reef start - skip useless entity move packets
+                // Every 60 ticks a position packet is sent even if the entity hasn't moved. If the
+                // encoded movement is zero it changes nothing on the client, so don't send it.
+                // (On-ground changes always go through the full sync packet above.)
+                if (dev.reef.ReefConfig.skipUselessMovePackets
+                    && packet instanceof ClientboundMoveEntityPacket.Pos movePacket
+                    && movePacket.getXa() == 0 && movePacket.getYa() == 0 && movePacket.getZa() == 0) {
+                    packet = null;
+                }
+                // Reef end - skip useless entity move packets
+
                 if (this.entity.needsSync || this.trackDelta || this.entity instanceof LivingEntity && ((LivingEntity)this.entity).isFallFlying()) {
                     Vec3 deltaMovement = this.entity.getDeltaMovement();
                     double d = deltaMovement.distanceToSqr(this.lastSentMovement);
